   266	## Trust boundary
   267	
   268	- `reference-semantics/`: fixed, supplied operational semantics. It affects
   269	  value, control, state, and exceptions in both formal claims. Every claim
   270	  depends on it. It is not proved equivalent to CPython here; the theorem is
   271	  explicitly conditional on it. Evidence: required LLVM execution of the exact
   272	  solution body and agreement with CPython/oracle cases.
   273	- K v7.1.293, its Haskell reachability backend, and its SMT reasoning are
